<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ ups Federal-Mogul to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ ups Federal-Mogul to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin analyst Wendy Needham raised her rating on autoparts supplier Federal-Mogul Corp to buy from market perform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was traveling and no one was available to confirm the move, her office said.</p>
</text>
